cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Shape bias is a readout property: a developmental two-stream model, frozen networks and human cortex"
abstract: >-
  Code and analysis for a two-stream network receiving approximations of the
  magnocellular and parvocellular signals reaching cortex, with the encoding,
  behavioural, readout and single-trunk generality analyses built on it.
type: software
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/LuZeking/Magno-Parvo-Konio-Net"
url: "https://github.com/LuZeking/Magno-Parvo-Konio-Net"
